Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Aman Kushwaha",
  "email": "aman@examples.com",
  "age": 22
}


### Delete User
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/users/3


### Get Users - Page 1
GET http://localhost:5000/api/users?page=2&limit=1



### Get Users - Page 1
GET http://localhost:5000/api/users?sortBy=age&order=desc


